<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="waist">
<span class="c6">Waist for Unholy Death Knight DPS Phase 4</span></h3>Until you're wearing Shadowmourne, none of the new options available in ICC are particularly exciting, but once moving to 2H they nearly double in gained dps. There are Four 264 plate belts that all sim nearly exactly the same with the only real variation coming from expertise/<wbr/>hit cap or increased value of Armor Penetration when using Shadowmourne, and as such are all grouped together. <br/>
