<span class="c6">Trinkets for Unholy Death Knight DPS Phase 4</span></h3>
<div class="pad"></div>Would that we could, use two Death's Choice for the rest of the expansion, unfortunately Blizzard wont allow us to stack the normal and heroic versions. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50363/deathbringers-will">
